I started off investigating Yu Tsumura's 554 Problem then went off track and ended up elsewhere - the original study is still at the beginning of the Notebook and offers an alternative perspective to exploe number problems such as this.
This study demonstrates an understanding of the complexities involved, the arbitrary nature of the current rules, and provides a clear, comparative analysis of how different rules lead to different outcomes. 
